- entry .WeekdayOrdinal   one `BYDAY` entry of a recurrence rule: a weekday, optionally with an ordinal
+ entry .WeekdayOrdinal   одна запись `BYDAY` правила повторения: день недели, возможно с порядковым номером

= entry .WeekdayOrdinal   one `BYDAY` entry of a recurrence rule: a weekday, optionally with an ordinal
-   detail
+   detail

-       `WeekdayOrdinal(weekday, ordinal = Unset)` is one element of `Rrule#byDay`. A bare weekday
-       (`WeekdayOrdinal(Tue)`, RFC 5545 `TU`) selects every Tuesday in the period; with an
-       ordinal it selects one — `WeekdayOrdinal(Mon, 3)` is the third Monday (`3MO`) and
-       `WeekdayOrdinal(Fri, -1)` the last Friday (`-1FR`), counting back from the end. The
-       ordinal is meaningful only under `Frequency.Monthly` and `Frequency.Yearly`; under
-       `Weekly` and `Daily` a weekday acts as a filter and the ordinal is ignored.
+       `WeekdayOrdinal(weekday, ordinal = Unset)` — один элемент `Rrule#byDay`. Голый день недели
+       (`WeekdayOrdinal(Tue)`, `TU` в RFC 5545) выбирает каждый вторник периода; с порядковым
+       номером он выбирает один — `WeekdayOrdinal(Mon, 3)` — третий понедельник (`3MO`), а
+       `WeekdayOrdinal(Fri, -1)` — последняя пятница (`-1FR`), считая от конца. Порядковый номер
+       имеет смысл только при `Frequency.Monthly` и `Frequency.Yearly`; при `Weekly` и `Daily`
+       день недели действует как фильтр, а порядковый номер игнорируется.

